; Firmware cho ESP32-CAM (AI-Thinker): ket noi WiFi, chup anh khi laptop goi http://esp32cam.local/capture
;
; Chay tu thu muc goc heThongTuoiCayTT:
;   pio run -d esp32cam -t upload                 nap qua WiFi (env ota, mac dinh)
